# NusaCss Motion

Use NusaCss Motion for browser animations.

## Vanilla JavaScript

Import from `nusa-css/motion`.

```js
import { motion } from "nusa-css/motion";

motion.animate(".element", {
  opacity: [0, 1],
  y: [30, 0]
}, {
  duration: 700,
  easing: "ease-out"
});
```

## React

Use the React adapter from `nusa-css/react`.

## React Native

Use `MotionView` from `nusa-css/native`.

Do not use browser DOM APIs in React Native.
Do not access `document` or `Element` in native components.
Respect reduced-motion preferences when implementing user-facing animations.
